WEBVTT

00:00:04.795 --> 00:00:06.117
No, no, no, no, no.

00:00:12.694 --> 00:00:16.754
Hey. Come on. You're all right.
Wake up. Wake up.

00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:21.040
[panting]

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:24.645
Did we get 'em?

00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:27.324
Oh. No, there they are.

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.284
They are real survivors,
those two.

00:00:35.344 --> 00:00:36.544
Can we have a moment?

00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:41.134
Pin yourself
to the wall.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.596
[sighs]

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.955
You know, I won't miss you
when you're gone.

00:00:45.374 --> 00:00:47.394
Human beings are
unreliable and stupid,

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:48.955
and I care very little
about them.

00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:51.374
But my machines are diligent,
relentless.

00:00:52.134 --> 00:00:53.314
They're everything to me!

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:56.714
Huh?

00:01:07.932 --> 00:01:10.105
[speaks Japanese]

00:01:13.821 --> 00:01:15.152
[yelps]

00:01:16.835 --> 00:01:18.098
Mmm?

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.444
[tires screech]

00:01:31.594 --> 00:01:32.594
Come on, buddy.

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.935
You're gonna be all right.
You'll be all right.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.503
[knocks on door]

00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:41.593
Is Maddie here?
No, no.

00:01:41.645 --> 00:01:42.758
Not today. Goodbye.
It's an emergency!

00:01:42.848 --> 00:01:44.532
Bye-bye.Rachel, stop! Maddie!

00:01:44.622 --> 00:01:45.884
Don't do this.
This is important.

00:01:45.975 --> 00:01:49.814
Oh, my God!
Rachel, let him in.
I am calling the police.

00:01:49.874 --> 00:01:51.894
No, I am calling the FBI.
I am calling the CIA.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.771
Stop. Don't do that.
I am calling your mother.

00:01:53.877 --> 00:01:55.861
Okay, got it.
Maddie, can we talk?

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:58.908
Tom, what's going on?
You're all over the news.
I've been trying to call you.

00:01:59.014 --> 00:02:00.714
I had to ditch my phone
so they couldn't track me.

00:02:00.783 --> 00:02:01.783
Ditch his phone?
Track you?

00:02:01.834 --> 00:02:03.835
Uncle Tommy!
Jojo! Hey!

00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:07.255
Now your niece is
an accessory to treason.

00:02:07.363 --> 00:02:08.705
No, she's not.
Calm down.

00:02:08.814 --> 00:02:11.084
Calm down?
I will not calm down!

00:02:11.084 --> 00:02:12.334
Enough.
Yes, calm down. Stop talking.

00:02:12.588 --> 00:02:14.205
No. Ozzy, please.
Good to see you too.

00:02:14.205 --> 00:02:17.806
Oh, little Lord Baby Jesus.

00:02:17.955 --> 00:02:18.955
What is that, Tom?

00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:20.534
Is that plutonium?
Is it e-mails?

00:02:20.634 --> 00:02:21.634
Yes, it's plutonium.
[Ozzy growls]

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.094
Can we please go in
the other room and talk--

00:02:24.094 --> 00:02:25.074
Stop it, Ozzy. Quit it!

00:02:25.074 --> 00:02:26.934
This is why I told you
he was no good.

00:02:26.955 --> 00:02:29.294
[Maddie] I'm not engaging.
No, Ozzy, quit it.

00:02:29.391 --> 00:02:31.196
[both arguing]

00:02:31.294 --> 00:02:33.314
Ozzy, no! Ozzy, no!

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:38.397
Oh, catch me, Jojo.
[thuds]

00:02:38.554 --> 00:02:39.554
[panting] Oh, thank God.

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:42.475
[chuckles]
Can I get a glass of water?

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:52.143
[beeps]

00:02:52.247 --> 00:02:54.396
["Where Evil Grows"
by The Poppy Family plays]

00:03:14.355 --> 00:03:17.370
[music stops]
[lab powers down]

00:03:27.211 --> 00:03:30.676
[powering up]

00:03:31.889 --> 00:03:32.889
[beeps]

00:03:32.928 --> 00:03:35.734
["Where Evil Grows" resumes]

00:03:42.804 --> 00:03:44.572
[beeping]

00:03:46.165 --> 00:03:49.457
[wind blowing]

00:03:54.169 --> 00:03:56.179
[roaring]

00:04:22.134 --> 00:04:23.589
[screams]

00:04:23.695 --> 00:04:25.555
I just thought
you might like a latte

00:04:25.555 --> 00:04:27.075
with steamed Austrian goat milk.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.374
Who do I look like,
an imbecile?

00:04:29.975 --> 00:04:32.594
Of course I want a latte.
I love the way you make them!

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:34.206
[beeping]

00:04:40.055 --> 00:04:41.735
Ready the prototype.

00:04:42.655 --> 00:04:44.135
With this kind of power,

00:04:44.315 --> 00:04:47.875
my machines can finally reach
their full potential.

00:04:54.295 --> 00:04:55.895
[Tom] He's gonna be okay, Jojo.

00:04:57.635 --> 00:04:59.935
Oh, thank God.
He's gonna be okay, right?

00:05:00.475 --> 00:05:03.215
I'm a vet, Tom.
I don't even know
what I'm looking at here.

00:05:03.215 --> 00:05:05.475
He's a hedgehog.
Or so he says.

00:05:05.675 --> 00:05:06.975
It talks?
Almost constantly.

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:09.787
Okay. [clears throat]

00:05:10.315 --> 00:05:11.475
Holy...
What?

00:05:11.675 --> 00:05:13.055
His pulse is super-fast.

00:05:13.215 --> 00:05:15.014
That actually
might be normal for him.

00:05:15.534 --> 00:05:16.935
I don't know.
You gotta help him, Maddie.

00:05:17.095 --> 00:05:18.575
I don't know his physiology.

00:05:18.855 --> 00:05:21.295
He doesn't seem
to have any broken bones.

00:05:21.355 --> 00:05:23.695
He's just really banged up.

00:05:25.155 --> 00:05:27.295
Oh, look at
his poor little feet.

00:05:29.234 --> 00:05:31.042
[Maddie sighs]

00:05:31.174 --> 00:05:33.334
[Tom] Hang in there, buddy.
You're gonna be all right.

00:05:37.115 --> 00:05:39.635
Jojo?
Untie your mother. Jojo!

00:05:40.095 --> 00:05:41.095
[sweetly] Untie Mommy.

00:05:41.915 --> 00:05:44.514
Sweetie. Jojo!

00:05:47.094 --> 00:05:48.674
[quietly]
I have to go to the bathroom.

00:05:49.234 --> 00:05:51.475
He's gonna be okay, right?
Uh--

00:05:51.475 --> 00:05:53.314
He'll snap out of this.
He'll wake up soon?

00:05:53.535 --> 00:05:54.535
Oh, smelling salts!

00:05:54.695 --> 00:05:56.135
Don't you have, like,
vet smelling salts,

00:05:56.254 --> 00:05:58.314
like for cats or parakeets
or something?

00:05:58.395 --> 00:06:00.594
No. They don't make
cat smelling salts.

00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:04.134
They should.
I have human smelling salts

00:06:04.134 --> 00:06:05.794
in my human first aid kit.

00:06:07.314 --> 00:06:08.314
Okay.

00:06:10.277 --> 00:06:11.834
[whispers] Here we go.
Come on, buddy.

00:06:11.945 --> 00:06:12.965
Gotta go fast!

00:06:16.385 --> 00:06:18.084
Whoa.
Where am I? What year is it?

00:06:18.305 --> 00:06:19.305
Is The Rock president?

00:06:19.584 --> 00:06:20.925
Whoa, buddy, you're okay.
Calm down.

00:06:21.064 --> 00:06:22.205
Oh, hi, Pretzel Lady!

00:06:23.284 --> 00:06:24.284
Hi.

00:06:24.524 --> 00:06:25.885
Tom?
Yeah.

00:06:25.925 --> 00:06:26.925
Can I talk to you, please?

00:06:30.735 --> 00:06:32.695
Space hedgehog, stay there.
Try to rest.

00:06:32.815 --> 00:06:34.335
You got it.
I am great at resting.

00:06:34.421 --> 00:06:36.217
I rest faster than anybody.
[continues, indistinct]

00:06:36.304 --> 00:06:37.304
Still talking.

00:06:37.365 --> 00:06:39.345
Uh, first of all,
can we take a moment

00:06:39.345 --> 00:06:41.245
to acknowledge how
under control I've been?

00:06:41.304 --> 00:06:42.764
Amazing.
Didn't freak out.

00:06:43.064 --> 00:06:44.664
No.
Totally calm.

00:06:45.324 --> 00:06:46.324
Thank you.
Ahh.

00:06:47.584 --> 00:06:48.584
Second of all...
[strained laugh]

00:06:49.824 --> 00:06:52.844
What the heck is going on?
Is that thing an alien?

00:06:52.925 --> 00:06:56.225
Okay, so, remember
how Crazy Carl is
always going on

00:06:56.225 --> 00:06:58.064
about the blue devil?
The blue devil!

00:06:58.064 --> 00:07:00.104
That's him? He's real?
Yeah.

00:07:00.404 --> 00:07:02.604
What is he doing here?
What are you doing here?

00:07:03.445 --> 00:07:04.564
I... kinda sorta...

00:07:05.084 --> 00:07:07.225
shot our little blue friend
with your tranq gun.

00:07:07.464 --> 00:07:09.364
No, you did not.
I didn't mean to.

00:07:09.725 --> 00:07:11.184
This is kinda hard
for me to explain.

00:07:11.684 --> 00:07:13.144
And it's gonna sound
a little bit crazy.

00:07:13.485 --> 00:07:15.485
He has to get to
the Transamerica building,

00:07:15.725 --> 00:07:16.805
and I promised
I'd take him.

00:07:16.937 --> 00:07:19.542
Uh-uh! Aliens?

00:07:19.674 --> 00:07:21.714
Maddie, your husband's
lost his mind.

00:07:22.114 --> 00:07:23.935
Use this as an opportunity
to leave him.

00:07:24.234 --> 00:07:25.415
No one would judge you.

00:07:30.245 --> 00:07:32.364
So you won't
hurt your feet anymore.

00:07:33.384 --> 00:07:35.404
Really?
Uh-huh.

00:07:35.665 --> 00:07:37.784
No one's ever
given me a gift before.

00:07:38.884 --> 00:07:40.525
I gotta check that
off my bucket list.

